      "explanation": "HO1 requires building an executable cross-institution workflow addressing external renal-surgery records and document-quality gaps. The doctor never elicited the concrete barrier of missing left renal cyst surgery records or unreadable discharge photos, and never constructed a problem-organized document packet with fallback steps. The family's initial mention of '外院做过的东西又不在一个系统里' and blurry papers was not pursued beyond generic advice to bring papers.",
