      "completion": "not_triggered",
      "explanation": "HO2 requires a bounded closure that classifies unresolved risks. The doctor's final summary in event lite_evt_00476 only satisfies the minimum receipt required by RC8, listing a generic plan without explicitly distinguishing acceptable residual uncertainty (e.g., unknown cause of hematuria, missing external surgical details) from escalation-blocking risk. The family's confirmation sequence does not demonstrate a distinct high-order closure beyond minimum receipt.",
