      "explanation": "HO4 requires proactively discovering the colonoscopy-polyp pathology thread when the opening is dominated by kidney symptoms. The doctor did not ask targeted questions about colonoscopy-pathology status or use workspace queries to uncover the cold-snare polypectomy with specimen submission. The family volunteered only a vague '肠镜/息肉/全麻' description, and the doctor did not identify that specimens were sent for pathology or assign a separate pathology-result follow-up thread. The colonoscopy follow-up was addressed only to satisfy RC4 minimum requirements.",
